*
!Dockerfile
!overlay
!overlay/**
# Python leaves these behind next to the sources whenever a program here is
# byte-compiled by hand. They would be copied into the image by COPY overlay /.
#
# Excluding the directory alone is not enough: .dockerignore decides per path,
# and `overlay/**/__pycache__` matches only the directory entry, never the files
# inside it - which `!overlay/**` has already re-included. The contents need
# their own pattern.
overlay/**/__pycache__
overlay/**/__pycache__/**
overlay/**/*.pyc
